      "content": "hey, i have this massive headache starting up right now. it's super intense and on one side. i've had bad migraines before but this one feels a bit weird... my speech feels kinda thick and my lip looks a little droopy on the left side. is that just a weird aura thing with migraines? i really dont want to go to the er if i can just sleep it off",
