      "content": "thanks for the reassurance. i really wanted to avoid the hospital. you mentioned nerve compression or inflammation, do you think a heavy dose of ibuprofen or maybe some more prescription stuff like sumatriptan would help clear up the facial thing faster? i have some left over from last time.",
